% publisher-info-doi.pdf -- DOI only in the Info dictionary.
%
% Imitates the shape of a publisher PDF that stamps the article DOI into
% custom Info keys. Everything here is invented: the DOI prefix 10.1234
% is a test prefix and resolves to nothing.

[ /Title (A Study of Probe Fixtures)
  /Author (A. Fixture and B. Corpus)
  /Subject (Synthetic fixture for tiered extraction)
  /Creator (borax-tools fixture corpus)
  /CreationDate (D:20240103120000Z)
  /ModDate (D:20240103120000Z)
  /doi (10.1234/borax.2024.001)
  /WPS-ARTICLEDOI (10.1234/borax.2024.001)
/DOCINFO pdfmark

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 13 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto (A Study of Probe Fixtures) show
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
