72 684 moveto (A. Fixture and B. Corpus) show
72 654 moveto (Abstract. The identifier for this document lives in the) show
72 640 moveto (document information dictionary and nowhere else. The page) show
72 626 moveto (text deliberately carries no identifier of any kind.) show
showpage

